#
# Atomic spinlock primitives. Provides two classes: Spinlock for user-space
# or kernel code that manages interrupts externally, and SpinlockIrq for
# kernel-context use that automatically saves and restores interrupt state
# around lock acquisition to prevent deadlock from interrupt handlers.
